<Panels>
  <config><![CDATA[{
  "game_id": 73,
  "created_at": "2026-05-19T22:22:18.000Z",
  "level_num": "custom",
  "user_id": 1,
  "properties": {
    "panels": [
      {
        "key": "test-lesson-understanding-hyperlinks-f04da2a2-87a3-4451-ab5f-d58edfd0c371",
        "text": "We've learned to structure content within a single page. But how do we connect different pages to create a whole, navigable website?",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/e4411e7b810c1739ad22193955b668a3-test-lesson-understanding-hyperlinks-panel-1-13e06e24-5a12-4c29-a032-1eb0e2092548.png",
        "layout": "text-top-center"
      },
      {
        "key": "test-lesson-understanding-hyperlinks-5042c013-4c1b-486a-a1bf-a2dd2f4a0f04",
        "text": "This is where the `<a>` tag, often called an \"anchor\" tag, comes in! It lets us create **hyperlinks** to other places on the web.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/a4cfc2dc0eb0ca2af35627b6d7b84a23-test-lesson-understanding-hyperlinks-panel-2-23c814c7-b5b4-479f-a98b-da3cf906e77c.png",
        "layout": "text-top-center"
      },
      {
        "key": "test-lesson-understanding-hyperlinks-4561b632-dbdc-42ad-ade7-e0e86fb14f01",
        "text": "The secret ingredient for a link is the `href` attribute. It's like the address label, telling your browser exactly *where* to go when someone clicks the link!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/6af0fa9543330772bbe1d5a494077f98-test-lesson-understanding-hyperlinks-panel-3-1c7fd2de-41d9-4fa0-ade2-fa164809e7b3.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-center"
      },
      {
        "key": "test-lesson-understanding-hyperlinks-f1c22ed8-f75a-4899-83f1-2cbb28990dbc",
        "text": "You can use links to jump between pages *within* your own website, or even connect to completely *different* websites across the vast internet!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/920f0e3b966bfe1c152d0ebbc4c6a01e-test-lesson-understanding-hyperlinks-panel-4-09bea418-d481-4a73-a19c-3498e61d999e.png",
        "layout": "text-top-center"
      }
    ],
    "generate_outline": "Explain the purpose of hyperlinks (<a>) and the 'href' attribute for connecting web pages. Discuss how links allow users to navigate between different parts of a site or to external resources."
  },
  "published": true,
